(Vehicle Maintenance Policy) '
(Effective January 01, 2027) '
() '
(2. Replacement Period:) '
(2.1. The vehicle may be replaced on completion of seven years of life.) '
() '
(4. Consumables and Parts Replacement:) '
(4.1. The company will accept the replacement of oil and filters after every) '
(4 months or 6000km, whichever is earlier.) '
(4.2. The company shall provide one-time seat covers subject to a maximum) '
(budget of PKR 15,000 per vehicle.) '
ET
